A number is divisible by k when:
sum % k == 0
if the subarray starts at i and ends at j, its length is:
j - i + 1

Brute force Approach:
class Solution {
    public boolean checkSubarraySum(int[] nums, int k) {
        for(int i=0;i<nums.length;i++){
            int sum=0;
            for(int j=i;j<nums.length;j++){
                sum+=nums[j];
                if(j - i + 1 >= 2 && sum % k ==0){
                    return true;
                }
            }
        }
        return false;
    }
}

Time  → O(n²)
Space → O(1)

class Solution {
    public boolean checkSubarraySum(int[] nums, int k) {
        HashMap<Integer,Integer>hmap=new HashMap<>();
        hmap.put(0,-1);
        int prefixSum=0;
        for(int i=0;i<nums.length;i++){
            prefixSum+= nums[i];
            int reminder=prefixSum % k;
            if(hmap.containsKey(reminder)){
                if(i - hmap.get(reminder) >=2 ){
                    return true;
                }
            }else{
            hmap.put(reminder, i);
            }
        }
        return false;

    }
}

Time  → O(n)
Space → O(n)
